Event,Ethics Committee Revision,"Add an 'Ethical Risk' of +2 to one Method card in any stack.",,,,
Event,Fieldwork Delay,"Target player must discard one unscored Method card from one of their stacks.",,,,
Event,Funding Boost,"Draw 2 cards from the draw pile.",,,,
Event,Equipment Failure,"Target one Method card in an opponent's stack. They must discard one card from their hand to keep it.",,,,
Event,Interlibrary Loan Miracle,"Draw 1 Theory/Framework card from the draw pile or the discard pile.",,,,
Event,Conference Deadline,"Immediately score a chosen stack (min 1 Method) but it scores as a Mixed Paradigm (+3 points), ignoring other Paradigm bonuses or penalties.",,,,
Event,Reviewer 2 Demands Revisions,"Re-open an opponent's completed stack. They must add one more Method card to it on their next turn to re-complete it.",,,,
Event,Access Granted,"Remove 1 Ethical Risk from a Method card containing Archival, Survey, or Digital Humanities Method.",,,,
Event,Participant Withdrawal,"A player using a method with Ethical Risk of 6 or higher must discard that Method or discard 2 cards from their hand.",,,,
Event,Major Breakthrough,"Choose one of your incomplete research stacks. Immediately score it as a Coherent Paradigm (+10 points), ignoring any incompatibilities or minimum Method requirements.",,,,
Event,Prestigious Fellowship,"For the rest of the game, your maximum hand size is increased to 9 cards. Additionally, immediately search the draw pile or the discard pile for any one card and add it to your hand.",,,,
Event,Catastrophic Hard Drive Failure,"Choose an opponent. They must immediately discard their most developed (most cards) incomplete research stack.",,,,
Event,Data Failure: Cloud Service Hack,"'password12345' wasn't secure. This is bad for you. Choose one of your incomplete stacks. All Method cards in it have their Reproducibility and Sensibility scores permanently reduced to 1. If you have no incomplete stacks, discard 3 cards.",,,,
Event,Interdisciplinary Symposium,"Starting with you, every player draws two cards. Afterwards, every player must discard one card.",,,,
Event,University-Wide Restructuring,"'Senior management receive 50 bonus coins (even though coins are not part of this game).' All players must move one card from each of their incomplete stacks to the discard pile. Then, discard down to 5 cards in hand.",,,,
